{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — A practical, sensory approach to feeling more like you</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Signature aromatherapy blends and single-session add-ons that may support mood and daily rhythm. Safety-forward guidance included." />
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 100 100'%3E%3Crect width='100' height='100' rx='18' fill='%239ad1c9'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="site-root">
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div class="tag">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
      </div>
      <nav class="main-nav">
        <a href="index.html" class="nav-link">Home</a>
        <a href="services.html" class="nav-link">Offerings</a>
        <a href="blends.html" class="nav-link">Blends</a>
        <a href="shop.html" class="nav-link">Emporium</a>
        <a href="pricing.html" class="nav-link">Rates</a>
        <a href="about.html" class="nav-link">About</a>
        <a href="book.html" class="nav-link">Reserve</a>
        <a href="contact.html" class="nav-link">Connect</a>
      </nav>
      <a id="top-cta" class="btn btn-primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero glass">
        <svg class="hero-pattern" width="100%" height="120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="none"><defs><pattern id="patt" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" width="60" height="60"><image href="assets/img/pattern.svg" x="0" y="0" width="60" height="60"/></pattern></defs><rect width="100%" height="120" fill="url(#patt)" opacity="0.12"/></svg>
        <div class="hero-inner">
          <h1>Thoughtfully made scent supports for everyday moments</h1>
          <p class="lead">Small, intentional blends and single-session add-ons that may support rest, focus, or calm—framed as sensory tools rather than treatments.</p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a id="hero-cta" class="btn btn-cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">Start with a scent suggestion</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="services.html">View Offerings</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="social-proof">
        <h2>What clients say</h2>
        <div class="testimonials">
          <blockquote>"The small rituals helped me notice my day differently — gentle and doable."<cite>— S., {{CITY}}</cite></blockquote>
          <blockquote>"Clear instructions and blends I actually use."<cite>— P., {{STATE}}</cite></blockquote>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="traits glass">
        <h2>How we think about scent</h2>
        <ul class="benefit-list">
          <li><strong>Practical olfaction:</strong> Tools you can bring into routines.
          </li>
          <li><strong>Safety-first:</strong> Guidance on dilution, patch-testing, and sensitive situations.
          </li>
          <li><strong>Flexible support:</strong> Blends and add-ons designed to fit alongside care you already have.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

      <section class="interactive-process">
        <div class="process-left glass">
          <h3>Mood-to-Method selector</h3>
          <p>Choose how you feel now. We'll suggest a way to use scent and update the action below.</p>
          <label for="mood">How are you right now?</label>
          <select id="mood" aria-label="Mood selector">
            <option value="neutral">Neutral / curious</option>
            <option value="tired">Tired & low energy</option>
            <option value="anxious">Anxious or unsettled</option>
            <option value="scattered">Scattered / distracted</option>
            <option value="sleepy">Preparing for sleep</option>
            <option value="joyful">Want to lift the mood</option>
          </select>
          <div id="method" class="method-suggestion">
            <h4>Suggested approach</h4>
            <p class="method-copy">Select a mood to see a gentle method that may support that state.</p>
          </div>
          <a id="mood-cta" class="btn btn-cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
        </div>

        <aside class="process-right glass">
          <h3>Aroma wheel</h3>
          <p>Hover or focus notes to learn about top, middle and base impressions.</p>
          <div class="wheel-wrap" aria-hidden="false">
            <svg id="aroma-wheel" viewBox="0 0 300 300" role="img" aria-label="Aroma wheel">
              <defs>
                <radialGradient id="g1"><stop offset="0%" stop-color="#fff"/><stop offset="100%" stop-color="#e9fff7"/></radialGradient>
              </defs>
              <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="140" fill="url(#g1)" stroke="#ffffff22" stroke-width="2"/>
              <!-- base notes ring -->
              <g class="ring base" transform="translate(150,150)">
                <circle r="110" fill="transparent" />
                <g id="base-notes">
                  <path data-tier="base" data-note="Vetiver" data-desc="Earthy, grounding; may support stability when blended carefully." d="M110 0 A110 110 0 0 1 33 105 L0 0 Z" fill="#c9efd9" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="base" data-note="Cedarwood" data-desc="Warm woody anchor; often used to add persistence to a blend." d="M33 105 A110 110 0 0 1 -89 65 L0 0 Z" fill="#bfe7d0" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="base" data-note="Patchouli" data-desc="Deep, rich base notes that a little goes a long way." d="M-89 65 A110 110 0 0 1 -89 -65 L0 0 Z" fill="#b3e1c6" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="base" data-note="Amber" data-desc="Resinous warmth to round a blend; consider sensitive-skin cautions." d="M-89 -65 A110 110 0 0 1 33 -105 L0 0 Z" fill="#a7d9bd" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="base" data-note="Sandalwood" data-desc="Creamy woody base, used sparingly; safe sourcing matters." d="M33 -105 A110 110 0 0 1 110 0 L0 0 Z" fill="#9fd1b4" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                </g>
              </g>
              <!-- middle notes ring -->
              <g class="ring middle" transform="translate(150,150)">
                <circle r="70" fill="transparent" />
                <g id="middle-notes">
                  <path data-tier="middle" data-note="Lavender" data-desc="Floral-herbaceous; commonly used for promoting calm when used appropriately." d="M70 0 A70 70 0 0 1 21 67 L0 0 Z" fill="#ffdfe9" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="middle" data-note="Geranium" data-desc="Rose-like middle note that can add floral lift to a blend." d="M21 67 A70 70 0 0 1 -45 52 L0 0 Z" fill="#ffe6df" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="middle" data-note="Clary Sage" data-desc="Herbaceous and slightly balsamic; use with attention to individual responses." d="M-45 52 A70 70 0 0 1 -45 -52 L0 0 Z" fill="#fff4dc" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="middle" data-note="Rose" data-desc="Distinct floral character; often used sparingly and with dilution guidance." d="M-45 -52 A70 70 0 0 1 21 -67 L0 0 Z" fill="#fff0f0" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="middle" data-note="Chamomile" data-desc="Soft, apple-like middle note; consider allergy and sensitivity notes before use." d="M21 -67 A70 70 0 0 1 70 0 L0 0 Z" fill="#fff6e8" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                </g>
              </g>
              <!-- top notes ring -->
              <g class="ring top" transform="translate(150,150)">
                <circle r="30" fill="transparent" />
                <g id="top-notes">
                  <path data-tier="top" data-note="Bergamot" data-desc="Bright citrus top note; photosensitivity can be a consideration—check dilution." d="M30 0 A30 30 0 0 1 9 29 L0 0 Z" fill="#fff9d6" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="top" data-note="Lemon" data-desc="Sharp citrus lift; avoid direct skin exposure without dilution." d="M9 29 A30 30 0 0 1 -19 22 L0 0 Z" fill="#fffed6" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="top" data-note="Sweet Orange" data-desc="Familiar, sweet citrus top note; pet safety and dilution matter." d="M-19 22 A30 30 0 0 1 -19 -22 L0 0 Z" fill="#fff7d0" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="top" data-note="Peppermint" data-desc="Cool, bright top note; strong and possibly irritating in high concentrations." d="M-19 -22 A30 30 0 0 1 9 -29 L0 0 Z" fill="#e8fff7" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                  <path data-tier="top" data-note="Grapefruit" data-desc="Citrus lift with a slightly bitter edge; photosensitivity considerations apply for some oils." d="M9 -29 A30 30 0 0 1 30 0 L0 0 Z" fill="#fff8e3" stroke="#00000011"></path>
                </g>
              </g>
              <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="28" fill="#ffffff" stroke="#e6f7f0"/>
              <text x="150" y="154" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="#226a5a">Smell map</text>
            </svg>
          </div>
          <div id="note-info" class="note-info" aria-live="polite">Hover a note for a short description.</div>
        </aside>
      </section>

      <section class="process glass">
        <h2>How a typical session or add-on works</h2>
        <ol>
          <li><strong>Check-in:</strong> A brief intake to understand sensitivities and goals.</li>
          <li><strong>Patch & dilute:</strong> We demonstrate safe dilution ratios and patch testing steps.</li>
          <li><strong>Single-session or takeaway:</strong> Choose a short inhalation practice or a custom blend to take home.</li>
        </ol>
      </section>

      <section class="faq glass">
        <h2>Frequently asked safety questions</h2>
        <details>
          <summary>Do these scents replace medical care?</summary>
          <p>They do not. Aromatherapy may support well-being but is not a substitute for professional medical advice or treatment.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>How do you recommend diluting oils?</summary>
          <p>We offer conservative dilution guidance (typically 1-2% for blends intended for topical use). Patch testing is advised before wider use.</p>
        </details>
        <details>
          <summary>What about pets and pregnancy?</summary>
          <p>Some essential oils can affect pets or be inadvisable during pregnancy. We always provide alternative options; consult your healthcare provider when in doubt.</p>
        </details>
      </section>

      <section class="final-cta glass">
        <div class="cta-inner">
          <h2>Ready to try a sensory tweak?</h2>
          <p>Book a short consult or select a ready-to-use blend from the Emporium. Choose what fits your day.</p>
          <div class="cta-actions">
            <a class="btn btn-cta" href="book.html">Reserve a quick consult</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline" href="shop.html">Browse blends & add-ons</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <div>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} • <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> • <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
      <small>Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Information provided is informational; safety notes apply.</small>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
